oking at the  lorises profile on the screen I'm not  sure what that means but it's definitely  there for a reason so this could support  the idea that she found out that Barnard  was a host or that there's been big  changes to Dolores that's gonna cause  this whole thing at the end but we  really don't know how that plays into  things until we know how she ended up  getting out of that theater which was  not in a body bag as far as I'm  concerned there are people who think  that it might be that she was killed and  he was making her replacement as a host  but Jonathan Nolan did say in an  interview that that host being made when  Theresa there was just for a dramatic  effect like he made a point of it so and  that if that's the case then it wouldn't  be misdirection it'd be an outright lie  that he lied to us about what that is  therefore he could have just said you'll  find out later or something like that  but he said it was basically nothing  that was just there as a prop so let me  know what you guys think in the comments  this is the all the evidence I could  find I'm in the camp that they're both  still alive Stubbs and LC and they're  both  back to play a role I'm not a hundred  percent sure what that'll be so let's  talk about it and let's see what we come  up with I'm still thinking about doing  the Q&amp;A and with a couple other  Westworld videos but I'm gonna be back  on Game of Thrones for the next couple  days so if you have questions that you  want me to address leave them in the  comments make sure you like the video  and please subscribe to my channel  thanks for watching I'll talk to you  soon
 

